otengine/godot/issues/108122","id":3047158662,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc61n_OG","user":{"login":"Kazuo256","id":645222,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NTIyMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/645222?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazuo256","html_url":"https://github.com/Kazuo256","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazuo256/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazuo256/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazuo256/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazuo256/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazuo256/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazuo256/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazuo256/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazuo256/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazuo256/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-08T02:34:45Z","updated_at":"2025-07-08T02:34:45Z","body":"> You can't just connect `script_changed` to `_update_script_button()`, because it will update the button for every selected node. It should happen only once. You can add something like `_queue_update_script_button()`.\r\n\r\nMakes sense. Do you have a suggestion for where to check for queued updates? My first guess would under the `NOTIFICATION_PROCESS` case in the `_notification()` method.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3047158662/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3048331563","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108122#issuecomment-3048331563","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108122","id":3048331563,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc61sdkr","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-08T10:32:55Z","updated_at":"2025-07-08T10:32:55Z","body":"The usual pattern is\r\n```\r\nvoid queue_update() {\r\n\tif (is_update_queued) {\r\n\t\treturn\r\n\t}\r\n\tis_update_queued = true\r\n\tcall_deferred(\"actual_update\")\r\n}","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3048331563/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3051094583","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108122#issuecomment-3051094583","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108122","id":3051094583,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc613AI3","user":{"login":"Kazuo256","id":645222,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NTIyMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/645222?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/user